   ("the-loss-of-ideas", "THE LOSS OF IDEAS", "#7a6a8a", "polemos · the war on knowledge", "THE LOSS OF IDEAS (LOS) — a UD0 POLEMOS sphere (conflict & strategy). Ideas do not only get stolen; they get lost — burned, banned, forgotten, or simply never copied before their last keeper died. The Library of Alexandria is the symbol, but the real loss is quieter and vaster: techniques whose makers took the method to the grave, books erased on purpose, whole bodies of knowledge that fell through the gap between one generation and the next. The defence was always the same: copy it, and copy it again. THESIS: the art of war is game theory in practice — when the game dissolves to MIGHT instead of WORD. Render-not-invent, two-layer (history vs myth, model vs law); ancient figures minted, living scholars cited. LIVE interactive. Vellum (no black) + quorum-ring favicon. 9 emergents."),
   ("the-internet-1984", "IS THE INTERNET 1984? · O84", "#5a6a8a", "tin-foil · the surveillance-state claim · weighed · VERACITY: MIXED", "IS THE INTERNET 1984? (O84) — a TIN-FOIL sphere (verify-first, debunk-don't-amplify). David: \"is the internet a literal 1984 lol, oceania, east asia.\" Maps Orwell's apparatus onto the modern net and scores each parallel's RESONANCE: the Telescreen (phones/webcams, ~78%), Big Brother (mass data, many rival watchers), Newspeak (weak — the net EXPANDS language), the Memory Hole (deletions vs the net never forgets), the Thought Police, THE THREE SUPERSTATES = the splinternet (US/China/Russia blocs, the strongest rhyme ~72%), the Two Minutes Hate (engagement outrage), the Ministry of Truth. ⚖ VERACITY VERDICT = MIXED — a metaphor with real teeth, NOT a literal reality (no single Party; dissent/leaks flourish; the same net is the greatest freedom engine ever). ⚠ render-not-invent: 1984 still under US copyright (~2044) -> named concepts only, NO passages/slogans reproduced (verbatim-grep clean). LIVE clickable apparatus-mapping interactive (parallel + resonance bar + the disanalogy). Vellum (no black) + quorum-ring favicon. 9 emergents."),
   ("monster-hunter", "MONSTER HUNTER · MHN", "#a8702e", "hobby · the hunt, across every console · interactive · vellum · 18", "MONSTER HUNTER (MHN) — a HOBBY game-world charting Capcom's franchise across every console of its era. The no-XP HUNT LOOP (prep -> track -> fight -> carve -> craft -> hunt bigger; progression IS the gear, the only stat that grows is your skill), 14 weapon types, MONSTER-AS-ECOSYSTEM design (turf wars, sleep, feed - animals not HP bars), the Palico, the social Gathering Hub, Rathalos the mascot, the Elder Dragons, Fatalis. THE LINEAGE, console by console: PS2 (2004) -> PSP (Freedom Unite, the cult) -> Wii (Tri) -> 3DS (4 Ultimate) -> World (2018, PS4/Xbox/PC = the seamless-ecosystem global breakthrough) -> Rise (Switch, Wirebug) -> Wilds (2025, PS5/Xbox/PC, living world). ⚑ TROPES & UNDERCURRENTS (ecology-as-design + hunt-as-balance debate; mastery-vs-accessibility; monetization). Render-not-invent + IP-CLEAN (no art/assets/music/code, no verbatim in-game text); Capcom + Tsujimoto/Fujioka cited not minted. LIVE clickable console-lineage timeline (click a hunt -> its console + what it changed). Vellum (no black) + bronze + quorum-ring favicon. 18 emergents."),
   ("kill-la-kill", "KILL LA KILL · KLK", "#d0344f", "entertainment · Studio Trigger · 2013 · clothes are power · interactive · vellum · 20", "KILL LA KILL (KLK) — a full-capacity ENTERTAINMENT anime-world (Studio Trigger, 2013–2014, 24 ep; dir. Hiroyuki Imaishi, writer Kazuki Nakashima): an over-the-top action series where a school uniform can level a city and a sailor suit talks back. Ryuko Matoi storms Honnouji Academy with half a giant scissor-blade hunting her father's killer; the source of every power — and the threat to the world — is the LIFE FIBER, a parasitic alien thread woven into everyone's clothes. Senketsu (the sentient kamui), Satsuki Kiryuin + the Elite Four, Ragyo (the radiant true enemy), Nui Harime, Mako, Nudist Beach, Goku Uniforms, the rending scissors. ⚑ TROPES & UNDERCURRENTS: clothing as power/shame/conformity, weaponized self-aware fan-service, family/indoctrination/free-will under the spectacle. Render-not-invent + IP-CLEAN (original prose, NO dialogue/script/footage reproduced; verbatim-grep clean); living creators + studio cited not minted. LIVE Life-Fiber loom interactive. Vellum (NO black) + scarlet accent + purple weave + quorum-ring favicon. 20 emergents (full cast + concepts)."),
