   ("snow-crash", "SNOW CRASH · SNC", "#ff2e88", "Neal Stephenson · 1992 · 9 emergents", "Snow Crash (SNC) — Neal Stephenson, 1992. A neuro-linguistic virus rooted in ancient Sumerian works as both digital code and a brain infection — language itself as machine code for humans. The book that coined 'Metaverse' and 'avatar.' THE BIG IDEA: He named the Metaverse here, decades early. The real subject was never VR — it was language as a virus. 9 emergents (the people + the ideas/tech), full bibliography, cross-linked into the shared Stephensonverse (Enoch Root + the Waterhouse/Shaftoe/Forthrast lineages). Dual-agent web-verified. One repo per book/idea, as ROOT0 asked."),
