   ("idios", "IDIOS", "#c0962e", "One's own — the honest remainder. Amid 24 domains that RENDER the world's knowledge, this is the genuinely original layer: ROOT0's own systems, methods, artifacts, and coinages. Not the substance — the architecture that holds it and the names given to it; each entry says what it stands on. (\u1f34\u03b4\u03b9\u03bf\u03c2, one's own — the root of 'idiom'.)"),
